{"steam_appid":230290,"steam_name":"Universe Sandbox","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/230290/41602/3ea9be80e860063b26a02377f6e19b8b74492bb5/1750482542/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741037598","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256655880/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1741037598","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/51403cdf946510e4031f1ae4bed2dd69d5cd473f/ss_51403cdf946510e4031f1ae4bed2dd69d5cd473f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745448523","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/0725d96f2fb6b74cc79eba09bbd6707dae05e523/ss_0725d96f2fb6b74cc79eba09bbd6707dae05e523.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745448523","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/0093bf0d15a3a5598a4dca691769a5fcdb103a62/ss_0093bf0d15a3a5598a4dca691769a5fcdb103a62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745448523","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/3a2385d10dfa28308ccd1abc3498d5d97aabe389/ss_3a2385d10dfa28308ccd1abc3498d5d97aabe389.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745448523","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/1237a0e77292b04d79d029b9fd3f753adb2f48fa/ss_1237a0e77292b04d79d029b9fd3f753adb2f48fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745448523"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universe Sandbox is a realistic physics-based space simulator that allows you to create, destroy, and interact on an unimaginable scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It merges real-time gravity, climate, collision, and material interactions to reveal the beauty of our universe and the fragility of our planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulate Gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N-body simulation at almost any speed using Newtonian mechanics. Real science, real physics, no supercomputer required. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.poster.avif?t=1745448523\" width=792 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.webm?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.mp4?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collide Planets &amp; Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, mind blowing collisions of massive planetary bodies that leave behind molten craters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1745448523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1745448523 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a star, then add a planet. Spruce it up with moons, rings, comets, or even a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.poster.avif?t=1745448523\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.webm?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.mp4?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Planetary Climate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch sea ice grow and recede with the seasons because of a planet’s tilt - change the tilt and change the seasons. Or move planets close to a star and see the oceans boil away as the surface heats up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1745448523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1745448523 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supernova a Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a supernova unfold by colliding two stars, cranking up their mass, or making them explode at your whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/292c1d428fc3ccd9c1cd5c3b1f8666cb.avif?t=1745448523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/292c1d428fc3ccd9c1cd5c3b1f8666cb.avif?t=1745448523 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Historical Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitch a ride with spacecraft including Juno and New Horizons, or view a total solar eclipse.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.poster.avif?t=1745448523\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.webm?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.mp4?t=1745448523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and terraform planets with 12 materials, including water, oxygen, &amp; carbon dioxide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar flares &amp; volatile trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated planets, stars, &amp; galaxies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulsars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-warping black holes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic space lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape oceans &amp; mountains on planet surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin planets apart with centrifugal force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Macoubre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 20+ languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share &amp; explore simulations on Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/c1a8188a458128fb180cf1ddb94056ab.avif?t=1745448523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/c1a8188a458128fb180cf1ddb94056ab.avif?t=1745448523 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 21H1+ (64-bit, x86)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz dual-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB Video Memory†, Shader Model 6.0<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> † Laptops or other computers that use integrated graphics (rather than dedicated graphics hardware) may see issues with Universe Sandbox even if they meet the video memory requirement. Dedicated video hardware is recommended.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.6 GHz quad-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8+ GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Giant Army"],"publishers":["Giant Army"],"release_date":"24 Aug, 2015"}